Package: pintora
Version: __VERSION__
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Pintora contributors
Description: Cross-platform raster graphics editor
 Pintora is an open-source raster graphics editor.
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libxrender1, libxext6
